he companion missions!\r\nthe back and forth for... everything. 30 seconds here, 30 seconds there and you're gone again. \r\nwith Andromeda II being shelved, the choices you make won't really matter like they do in ME Trilogy- but it's fun to see them get mad nonetheless \r\n", "timestamp_created": 1715768136, "timestamp_updated": 1715768136, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "165368193", "author": {"steamid": "76561198291716730", "personaname": "PurposeLess", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/idonthaveanidealol/", "num_games_owned": 425, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 4531, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4531, "last_played": 1715717006, "avatar": "a17c58b85677d419897cbefc4a4504f96e8cf39b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Tolerable open-world game with a Mass Effect skin on top. It's not bad, but nothing about it stands out. Also horribly optimized.", "timestamp_created": 1715717459, "timestamp_updated": 1715717459, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.585037946701049805", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "165361121", "author": {"steamid": "76561198418448262", "personaname": "MstrChfDan007", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mstrchfdan007/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 273, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 271, "last_played": 1715710919, "avatar": "d365fdedadee5db347270ee49661c4d3bf0d01ef"}, "language": "english", "review": "Literally could not be more disappointed with a game. Was really excited, there were no bugs or glitches and the game ran smoothly. The game just downright SUCKS! I played for 4.5 hours up til writing this review and so far this game lacks in every area. The story, boring, the gameplay, boring and the characters are forgetable with some of the worst voice acting imaginable. I really wanted to give a good review but I just can't. This is unacceptable.", "timestamp_created": 1715709728, "timestamp_updated": 1715709728, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474700063467025757", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "165354058", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123012942", "personaname": "NightSky", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/1762097/", "num_games_owned": 167, "num_reviews": 104, "playtime_forever": 1517, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 195, "last_played": 1757473047, "avatar": "ef9d780a6e28a992d28e32d84ee73be6edebeb81"}, "language": "english", "review": "(3 hours in)\n\nFantastic game! The only thing that sucks is that I waited this long to play it.\n\n(6 hours in)\n\nStory is great, there are a few inconvenient bugs here and there but nothing too bad. Sadly the game lacks in a good compass mission marker system as I've had multiple instances of having the mission marked but lead seemingly nowhere once on my ship.\n\nAll in All id give it a 7/10 good for on sale tbh.", "timestamp_created": 1715702458, "timestamp_updated": 1715999978, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "pri